sequenceDiagram
    actor Seller
    participant UI as React seller UI
    participant API as FastAPI authenticated API
    participant SQL as Isolated PostgreSQL
    Seller->>UI: Enter text and request draft
    UI->>API: Extract (offline provider in academic demo)
    API-->>UI: Grounded draft or clarification/fallback
    Note over API,SQL: No money operation before explicit confirmation
    Seller->>UI: Review and explicitly confirm
    UI->>API: POST operation with idempotency key
    API->>SQL: Atomic ownership check + ledger insert
    SQL-->>API: Committed operation
    API--xUI: Response lost (injected test)
    UI-->>Seller: Result unknown; original request retained
    Seller->>UI: Check result explicitly
    UI->>API: Same key and same body
    API->>SQL: Resolve prior operation
    SQL-->>API: Same operation; no duplicate
    API-->>UI: Confirmed result
    UI-->>Seller: Saved; dashboard values match SQL
